── SYNTAX ERROR ────────────────────────────── E0100_python_and.lt:1:53  [E0100]

Stilt writes `&&`, not `and`:

  1 │ fn both(ready: bool, allowed: bool) -> bool { ready and allowed }
    │                                                     ^^^

`&&`, `||` and `!` work on `bool`s.

To fix it, write `&&`:

  1 │ fn both(ready: bool, allowed: bool) -> bool { ready && allowed }
    │                                                     ~~
